<title>HUNGARY: Quaestor to start Budapest bourse trading Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Quaestor to start Budapest bourse trading Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Hungarian securities and investment house Quaestor Rt on the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) will start on Tuesday, the BSE said in a statement in its official gazette on Monday.</p>
<p>The BSE listed 616,277 Quaestor shares.</p>
<p>Each shares has a face value of 1,000 forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
